infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title 2PC vs saga: the isolation tradeoff
  desc Sagas swap 2PC's locks and isolation for non-blocking local commits
  compares
    - label Two-phase commit (2PC)
      children
        - label Isolation: yes
          desc Locks hide every intermediate state
        - label Atomicity: native
          desc All participants commit or all abort
        - label Locks: long-held, cross-service
          desc 8s gateway wait = 8s inventory lock
        - label Failure mode: stall
          desc Held locks + coordinator-uncertain participants
    - label Saga
      children
        - label Isolation: none
          desc Intermediate states are visible to others
        - label Atomicity: emulated
          desc Compensation undoes committed steps
        - label Locks: none
          desc Local transactions commit independently
        - label Failure mode: compensate
          desc Non-blocking, recoverable corrective writes
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
